# 🔧 Marketplace Backend

> ⚠️ **Learning Project** — This backend was built while learning Node.js, Express, and MySQL. It works, but it's not secure or production-ready. Database credentials are hardcoded. Don't deploy this as-is.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| **Runtime** | Node.js |
| **Framework** | Express |
| **Database** | MySQL (via `mysql2`) |
| **Middleware** | `cors`, `body-parser` |

---

## 📡 API Endpoints

### 👤 Users

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/getusers` | Get all users |
| GET | `/getuserid/:id` | Get user by ID |
| POST | `/addUser` | Register new user |
| POST | `/login` | User login (plaintext password) |
| PUT | `/updateuser/:id` | Update user (old route) |
| PUT | `/api/user_update/:id` | Update user |
| DELETE | `/api/user_delete/:id` | Delete user |

### 🛒 Products

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/product` | Get all products (user view) |
| GET | `/api/products-admin` | Get all products (admin view) |
| GET | `/api/products-user` | Get products from cart |
| POST | `/api/add-to-cart` | Add product to cart |
| POST | `/api/products-admin1` | Add product (admin) |
| PUT | `/api/products-admin/:id` | Update product (admin) |
| PUT | `/api/product-update/:id` | Update product |
| DELETE | `/api/product/:id` | Delete product |
| DELETE | `/api/product_delete/:id` | Delete product (alternative) |
| DELETE | `/api/products/:id` | Delete product from admin |

### 📬 Contact

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/getcontact` | Get all contact messages |
| POST | `/addContact` | Submit contact form |
| PUT | `/api/contact-update/:id` | Update contact message |
